# Auction module only

Until the user explicitly lifts this, work **only** on the Auction module.

## Allowed files (edit these only)

- `Pages/AuctionsPage.xaml` + `.xaml.cs`
- `Pages/AuctionEditPage.xaml` + `.xaml.cs`
- `Pages/AuctionReportPage.xaml` + `.xaml.cs`
- `ViewModels/AuctionsViewModel.cs`
- `ViewModels/AuctionEditViewModel.cs`
- `ViewModels/AuctionReportViewModel.cs`
- `Services/AuctionService.cs`
- `Services/AuctionsModuleGate.cs`
- `Domain/AuctionEntities.cs`

## Do not touch

Any other module, page, viewmodel, service, or shared/infra code, including but not limited to:

- `AppShell`, `MauiProgram`, `AuthService`, `ApiClient`
- `Data/JplDbContext.cs`, `Data/DbBootstrap.cs`
- `JPL.Api/**` (controllers, DTOs, entities, `ApiDbContext`, `LeagueDatabase`, `DeleteConstraints`)
- Players, Teams, Matches, Scoring, Reports (non-auction), Auth, Settings, or any other feature

If a requested Auction change seems to need a shared-file edit, **stop and ask** instead of editing that file.
